  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The electric potential at point A is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-50\"></span> V and the electric potential at point B is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"+150\"></span> V. An electron is moved from point A to point B and then back to point A. What is the total work done and what is the magnitude of the work done when moving the electron from point B to point A?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Total work done</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Magnitude of the work done when the electron is moved from B to A</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.032\"></span> fJ</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.64\"></span> fJ</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.032\"></span> fJ</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.32\"></span> fJ</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.64\"></span> fJ</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.32\"></span> fJ</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
  },
